489885de7b73"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The geometric, outer and inner products are represented on the screen by \
small circle, wedge and centered dot, respectively. For this purpose the \
Escape key should be used. ",
 StyleBox["Geometric product  is entered as ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 " \[EscapeKey]gp\[EscapeKey], outer product as \[EscapeKey]op\[EscapeKey], \
inner (Hestenes) product as \[EscapeKey]ip\[EscapeKey]. For example, in order \
to geometrically multiply two vectors type"
}], "Text",
