Cell[TextData[{
 "We often will need to generate symbolic multivectors, therefore we \
introduced ",
 StyleBox["gaGeneralMultivector[ ]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " procedure, which do the job. For example, if we need just scalar, vector \
and pseudovector, we can simply do "
