Cell["\<\
Below is a check from Lounesto \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Counter examples in \
Clifford algebras\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], which demonstrates that in the \
geometric product of two multivectors one cannot move Clifford conjugation \
from one factor to the other\
\>", "Text",
