Cell["\<\
Field elements can be input by typing two \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]e\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] letters, for example, \
e\[MediumSpace]e\[MediumSpace][index__Integer] in a similar way like for \
Clifford algebra described above. The two letters are then automatically \
replaced by double struck letter \[DoubleStruckF] (meaning field element). \
For example,\
