Cell["\<\
In plain representation multiplication of Clifford algebra over \
noncommutative field can be very slow. Therefore best way to to perform \
algebraic manipulations is to convert them into AssociationForm. First, let \
us construct  (symbolic) most general Clifford MV over quaternionic field \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.93980536664734*^9, 3.939805478065563*^9}, {
  3.939805968881803*^9, 
  3.939806046678111*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"706de5be-978e-4125-b6fa-\
4368276eb4bf"],

